      "text": [
        "Everything your website needs, in one place",
        "We handle the design, the build, the hosting and the fixes — so you're not stuck trying to update your own site or chasing a freelancer who's gone quiet.",
        "Design & build",
        "A clean, fast website written around what your business actually does — not a generic template stuffed with stock photos of people who aren't you.",
        "Hosting, included",
        "Your site lives on fast, secure UK-friendly hosting. Domain, SSL certificate and backups are all sorted and covered by your plan.",
        "Ongoing changes",
        "Menu updated, new prices, new opening hours, new photos — send us the details and we make the change. No web developer required on your end.",
        "Local SEO basics",
        "Your site is built to be found — proper page titles, fast load times, and a Google Business Profile set up so local customers can find you.",
        "Contact & booking",
        "Contact forms, click-to-call, WhatsApp links or a booking widget — whatever gets customers reaching out to you, built in from day one.",
        "Kept up to date",
        "We monitor uptime, keep software patched, and renew your domain and certificates automatically. You'll never get a \"site is down\" phone call.",
        "What we do"
