      "text": [
        "What business owners say",
        "\"I'd been putting off getting a website for two years because I thought it'd cost thousands. Doman had us live in three weeks and I actually understand what I'm paying for each month.\"",
        "\"Whenever I need the menu updated I just message the team and it's done same week. No faff, no invoice, it's just part of the plan. Wish I'd done this years ago.\"",
        "\"We switched from a big agency that charged us for every tiny edit. Doman Digital's monthly plan is a fraction of the cost and honestly the site looks better too.\"",
